{"unit_id":"qiuleec__DSH-wechat-export#feature-1","repo":"qiuleec/DSH-wechat-export","commit":"e218fdd0f375d800119b56bf07bf2d7981d9222f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-wechat-export 的功能「多格式会话归档」：把选中的微信会话写成 HTML 时间线、CSV 表格和 TXT 文本，并生成 JSON 汇总。通过面板或 agent 导出操作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.js:282-414","lib/export.js:154-248"]}
{"unit_id":"qiuleec__DSH-wechat-export#feature-2","repo":"qiuleec/DSH-wechat-export","commit":"e218fdd0f375d800119b56bf07bf2d7981d9222f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-wechat-export 的功能「增量导出」：按每个会话保存的时间与消息编号水位筛选新消息，输出独立增量文件；没有新内容时返回无更新结果。通过导出操作开启。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.js:304-407","lib/store.js:121-155"]}
{"unit_id":"qiuleec__DSH-wechat-export#feature-3","repo":"qiuleec/DSH-wechat-export","commit":"e218fdd0f375d800119b56bf07bf2d7981d9222f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-wechat-export 的功能「会话筛选与预览」：列出本机账号中的会话，可按类型筛选，并按会话标识预览最近消息。用户从面板或 agent 工具发起。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:170-205","lib/service.js:222-260","lib/service.js:520-556"]}
{"unit_id":"qiuleec__DSH-wechat-export#feature-4","repo":"qiuleec/DSH-wechat-export","commit":"e218fdd0f375d800119b56bf07bf2d7981d9222f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-wechat-export 的功能「定时导出」：允许设置每日时间或固定间隔，并由插件调度器运行导出、记录运行结果；面板也可立即运行一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.js:698-764","lib/scheduler.js:30-88"]}
{"unit_id":"qiuleec__DSH-wechat-export#caveat-1","repo":"qiuleec/DSH-wechat-export","commit":"e218fdd0f375d800119b56bf07bf2d7981d9222f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-wechat-export 使用前须知：密钥捕获依赖 Windows 微信进程及随包提供的捕获组件，首次捕获需退出后重新登录微信并在手机确认；环境不满足时无法取得数据库密钥。（见 lib/capture.js:170-220）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/capture.js:170-220"]}
